OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Budget pass Burnham's
OL,4,AMakerfield test?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn a wet Tuesday in October, Platt
OL,7,FBridge Community Centre, near Wigan, is
OL,8,Falive with the music of Shania Twain.
OL,9,FAbout 30 women and one man are line
OL,10,Fdancing to her hit Man! I Feel Like a
OL,11,FWoman! The class is so popular that the
OL,12,Fcentre has recently introduced an extra
OL,13,Fsession to meet demand.
OL,15,FThe community centre is in the heart of
OL,16,FAndy Burnham's constituency,
OL,17,FMakerfield, and they know all about
OL,18,Fbudgeting here. It is run entirely by
OL,19,Fvolunteers and has recently had to
OL,20,Fraise thousands of pounds for a new
OL,21,Froof.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
