OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Budget pass Burnham's
OL,4,AMakerfield test?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorman Smith is one of the trustees. He
OL,7,Fsays running the centre comes with
OL,8,Ftremendous financial challenges.
OL,10,F"It's a very old building, and
OL,11,Fsometimes the trustees feel like
OL,12,Fthey're trying to keep all the plates
OL,13,Fspinning, it's very hard at times."
